        "phase": '<p class="dmn"><b>Domain 10: Hematopoietic Stem Cell Transplant, Conditioning Therapy, Allogeneic HSCT</b></p><p class="T1"><b>Examples of various conditioning regimens by intensity</b></p><table class="table"><tr><td class="th"><p class="T2"><b>Myeloablative</b></p></td><td class="th"><p class="T2"><b>RIC</b></p></td><td class="th"><p class="T2"><b>Nonmyeloablative</b></p></td></tr><tr><td><p class="td_p">TBI &#x003E;500 cGy (single), &#x003E;800 cGy (fractionated)</p><p class="td_p">Cy &#x00B1; etoposide + TBI</p><p class="td_p">BU &#x003E;7.2 mg/kg intravenous (IV) + CY</p><p class="td_p">BU &#x003E;300 mg/m<sup>2</sup> IV</p><p class="td_p">Melphalan &#x003E; 150 mg/m<sup>2</sup></p><p class="td_p">Thiotepa &#x003E;10 mg/kg</p><p class="td_p">Treosulfan &#x003E;30 g/m<sup>2</sup></p></td><td><p class="td_p">TBI &#x2264; 500 cGy single fraction <i>or</i> &#x2264; 800 cGy fractionated</p><p class="td_p">Total BU &#x2264;9 mg/kg</p><p class="td_p">Total melphalan 140 mg/m<sup>2</sup></p><p class="td_p">Thiotepa &#x003C;10 mg/kg</p></td><td><p class="td_p">FLU + Cy + antithymocyte globulin (ATG)</p><p class="td_p">FLU + cytosine arabinoside (AraC) + Ida</p><p class="td_p">Cladribine + AraC</p><p class="td_p">Total lymphoid irradiation + ATG</p><p class="td_p">TBI &#x2264; 200 cGy &#x00B1; purine analog</p></td></tr></table>'
